## 4-ҚИСМ: /api/bert/synonyms endpoint

#### [MODIFY] backend/main.py
```python
@app.post("/api/bert/synonyms")
async def bert_synonyms(payload: Dict[str, Any]):
    word = payload.get("word", "")
    context = payload.get("context", "")
    
    # 1. BERT fill-mask — контекстда ўрнига нима тўғри келади
    masked = context.replace(word, "[MASK]")
    suggestions = bert_engine.engine.predict_mask(masked, top_k=5)
    
    # 2. Луғат frequency билан ранглаш
    ranked = rank_by_dictionary(suggestions)
    
    return {"synonyms": ranked, "source": "bert+dictionary"}
```
**Фойда**: Контекстга мос сўз тавсиялари (AI + луғат)

